  "summary": "A supply chain attack compromised the 'axios' npm package, using malicious versions to distribute a cross-platform RAT. The dropper, hidden in the 'plain-crypto-js' dependency, executed via a postinstall hook and fetched platform-specific implants for Windows, macOS, and Linux. All implants share a C2 protocol and use a distinctive, anachronistic IE8 User-Agent string for C2 communications.",
